{"data":{"title":"It's over now (Annie Starlight RMX)","slug":"its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx","path":"/artists/deborah-cox/tracks/it-s-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx/","artwork":"images/artists/deborah-cox/tracks/it-s-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx.jpg","artist":{"id":"MpCZuWU9e1s","slug":"deborah-cox","links":null,"title":"Deborah Cox","artwork":null},"id":"CpgGH_Oquhg"},"appearanceCount":4,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"sxI2ZGRLZTM","show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"T04UNC2holw","show":{"id":"hozdPs_wvok","slug":"178","title":"Soulection Radio Show #178","artwork":"/images/episodes/178.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-07-05T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"_4Iko_ZpqqE","show":{"id":"5Ym8VGymWIs","slug":"228","title":"Soulection Radio Show #228","artwork":"/images/episodes/228.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2015-10-02T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"z35BbCVUQzc","show":{"id":"ylNQtnFoFAo","slug":"336","title":"Soulection Radio Show #336","artwork":"/images/episodes/336.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-11-18T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":47773,"pl